{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14107350","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410733101:":{"text":"얌전히 있어!","source_cn":"老实点！<key:dialog42>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1AAC9F756E6561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410733102:":{"text":"젠장...","source_cn":"可恶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F874984482DC30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410733103:":{"text":"저리 가!","source_cn":"过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BA4B4C6DE2A314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410735001:0":{"text":"플린... 이 망할 놈. 감히 내 눈앞에 다시 나타나다니!","source_cn":"弗林……你这混球，还敢出现在我的面前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB850644D8A8F5C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410735002:0":{"text":"이 녀석들이 대체 무슨 짓을 한 겁니까! 감히 저희 두 종족의 관계를 깨뜨리려 하다니요!","source_cn":"这些混蛋都做了什么好事！竟敢破坏我们两族的关系！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF38FCD27587869B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410735003:0":{"text":"퀸 대제사장님, 걱정 마십시오! 제가 반드시 잘 처리하겠습니다!","source_cn":"奎茵大祭司，放心吧！我一定好好处理他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4920D4F2AFBAD42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410735004:0":{"text":"플린 씨, 여왕님께서는 외교 분쟁을 염려하시어, 이 두 사람을 당신에게 맡기시는 것입니다.","source_cn":"弗林先生，女王陛下担忧引起外交纠纷，所以特意将此二人转...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA5F5B1553E530F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410735005:0":{"text":"여왕님의 마음을 이해해 주셨으면 좋겠군요. 아무래도 셀로클랜드에서 일어나서는 안 되는 일이 생겼다 보니...","source_cn":"希望您能明白她的苦心，毕竟有些事情不该在萨洛克兰发生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0C29BB623AD2BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410735006:0":{"text":"압니다, 알고 말고요. 안심하셔도 됩니다.","source_cn":"明白明白，您放心就是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF4F48E0E7C5B88C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410735007:0":{"text":"흥, 능청스럽기는!","source_cn":"呸，装模作样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x328C904AD30DA4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410735008:0":{"text":"플린 씨, 예의를 모르는 드워프가 있으니 제대로 된 교육이 필요할 것 같군요.","source_cn":"弗林先生，有些矮人不懂礼数，看来还需要好好管教。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4F781AE292EFE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410735009:0":{"text":"대제사장님의 말씀이 맞습니다. 제가 아주 제대로... 가르치도록 하겠습니다.","source_cn":"大祭司说得对。回去后我一定好好……教训她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x219056E4A66CAFCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410735010:0":{"text":"시간이 늦었으니 우선 이 자들을 데리고 돌아간 다음, 다시 사죄하러 오도록 하겠습니다!","source_cn":"时候不早了，我们先带他们上去，之后再给您赔罪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50A0757E6BFECFB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410735011:0":{"text":"좋은 소식 기다리겠습니다. 안녕히 가세요.","source_cn":"那就期待您的好消息了，再会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x814FEDAC3868E904","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:22:1410733101:":{"text":"얌전히 있어!","source_cn":"老实点！<key:dialog42>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1AAC9F756E6561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:22:1410733102:":{"text":"젠장...","source_cn":"可恶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F874984482DC30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:22:1410733103:":{"text":"저리 가!","source_cn":"过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BA4B4C6DE2A314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:14010726:0":{"text":"퀸은 우리를 플린에게 넘겼다.","source_cn":"奎茵将你们移交给了弗林。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA893C4BBB90D1DB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"퀸은 우리를 플린에게 넘겼다.","female":"퀸은 우리를 플린에게 넘겼다.","variant_male_record_index":"166617","variant_female_record_index":"166618","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:14010726:0":{"text":"퀸은 우리를 플린에게 넘겼다.","source_cn":"奎茵将你们移交给了弗林。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA893C4BBB90D1DB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"퀸은 우리를 플린에게 넘겼다.","female":"퀸은 우리를 플린에게 넘겼다.","variant_male_record_index":"166617","variant_female_record_index":"166618","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:认真的卫兵":{"text":"진지한 경비병","source":"认真的卫兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗林":{"text":"플린","source":"弗林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奎茵":{"text":"퀸","source":"奎茵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":28,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":5}}